        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>诗歌鉴赏答题模式</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 587px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n    body {\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n      color: #111;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 587px;\n      padding: 57px 80px 0 80px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      line-height: 1.32;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n    p { margin: 0; }\n    .intro { margin-left: 25px; width: 355px; }\n    .intro p { margin-bottom: 4px; text-indent: -12px; padding-left: 12px; }\n    .eg { padding-left: 0 !important; margin-left: 0; }\n    .eg span { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; }\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 15px;\n      margin: 32px 0 8px 0;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      line-height: 1.2;\n    }\n    h2 {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      margin: 0 0 6px 8px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .section { margin-left: 27px; width: 348px; }\n    .item { margin: 3px 0 0 0; }\n    .label {\n      display: block;\n      margin-bottom: 1px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .sub {\n      margin-left: 7px;\n      line-height: 1.28;\n    }\n    .sub div { margin: 0; }\n    .answer {\n      margin-left: 8px;\n      margin-top: 2px;\n      line-height: 1.28;\n    }\n    .example { margin-left: 6px; margin-top: 4px; }\n    .poem {\n      width: 250px;\n      margin: 1px auto 3px auto;\n      text-align: center;\n      line-height: 1.3;\n    }\n    .note {\n      margin: 2px 0 0 0;\n      line-height: 1.3;\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n    .divider { height: 5px; }\n    .second h2 { margin-top: 2px; }\n    .bottom-poem {\n      margin: 2px auto 0 auto;\n      width: 230px;\n      text-align: center;\n      line-height: 1.32;\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"intro\">\n      <p>2、寄寓高尚的节操，或表达怀才不遇与命运多舛的伤感。或抒发年华易逝与理想破灭的感慨。</p>\n      <p>3、托物言志，寄托理想，或感慨伤世，或揭一腔忧愤，或抒发别愁。或冷嘲热讽。</p>\n      <p class=\"eg\"><span>Eg：</span>闺人借不与野芳争春，虽然粉身碎骨而芳香如故的梅花来表达自己虽遭受不幸，<br>前途坎坷，但决不向命运低头的高尚节操以及虽身碎骨而矢志不渝的斗争精神。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h1>诗歌鉴赏答题模式：</h1>\n\n    <h2>（一）&nbsp;分析意境型：</h2>\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <span class=\"label\">1、提问方式：</span>\n        <div class=\"sub\">此诗有什么样的意境？表现了怎样的画面？诗人通过什么景物表达自己的感情？</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <span class=\"label\">2、答题步骤：</span>\n        <div class=\"answer\">\n          <div>① 用4个字概括景物营造氛围特点</div>\n          <div>抓景分涂，营造意境；画意淡远；描绘画面；情景优美+明净悠闲；愁绪悲壮；</div>\n          <div>② 描写初中景物的途径和画面（翻译——忠于原文）。</div>\n          <div>③ 回答表现诗人什么感情（先答后面）。</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <span class=\"label\">3、答题示例：</span>\n        <div class=\"poem\">绝句二首（其一）　　杜甫<br>迟日江山丽，春风花草香。泥融飞燕子，沙暖睡鸳鸯。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\">注：此时写于诗人经过一岁四行役的奔波漂泊之后，暂时定居成都草堂时。<br>问：此诗描绘了怎样的景物？表达了诗人怎样的感情？请简要分析。<br>答：①这首诗描绘了一幅明净绚丽的图景。②此诗描绘一派美丽的初春景象：春天阳光普照，江水映日，春风送来花草的馨香；泥融之暖，燕子正忙的衔泥筑巢，日丽沙暖，鸳鸯在沙滩上静睡不动。③表现了诗人结束奔波漂泊生活安定后愉悦的心境。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"second\">\n      <h2>（二）&nbsp;分析技巧型：</h2>\n      <div class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"label\">1、提问方式：</span>\n          <div class=\"sub\">怎样的表现手法？怎样的艺术手法？怎样的技巧（手法）？怎样抒发感情的？</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"label\">2、答题步骤：</span>\n          <div class=\"answer\">\n            <div>① 明确告诉手法。</div>\n            <div>② 结合诗句证明为什么。</div>\n            <div>③ 运用这种手法有何表达法——而产生的一情感。</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"label\">3、答题示例：</span>\n          <div class=\"bottom-poem\">早行　　陈与义<br>露侵驼褐晓寒轻，星斗阑干分外明。<br>寂寞小桥和梦过，稻田深处草虫鸣。</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
